# Check record — VK-2 (monorepo#17): the public RPC hop ends at the node's own public listener.
#
# Not a roll: nothing was installed, restarted or changed. This is the stored run of
# deploy/check-public-rpc.sh that deploy/caddy/README.md step 4 asks for, on the fleet as it ran
# v0.8.8 on chain 22. Written by hand from the commands' output; every output block below is
# verbatim. Names only: the fleet's addresses are the operator's (the private configuration
# repository), so <web> and <e> stand for them here and addresses inside unit lines are cut.

release: v0.8.8 (abef4490), chain 22; the hosts answered build 0.8.8 abef4490
date: 2026-11-25
tool: deploy/check-public-rpc.sh sha256 90925276dbb9ae53add8bb4c85e3ae864a44faf6c60851848e912d2429e08682, last changed in 1b26ffddf5eb6716d19275ffebbc050f082a998a; run from origin/main 9dd2f3bae92e94d336be64704ee0a5d63cf37b18 (the same file as at tag v0.8.8)
read-only: JSON-RPC POSTs, and with --local one `systemctl show`
result: ok — four runs, four exit 0

check: 1 of 4 — on the web droplet, against the tunnel's local end (the run that shows where the public hop ends)
command: ssh -o BatchMode=yes -o ConnectTimeout=8 root@<web> 'bash -s -- --url http://127.0.0.1:18545' < deploy/check-public-rpc.sh
output:
    public-rpc: checked 2026-11-25T01:40:58Z url http://127.0.0.1:18545
    rand_chainId: 22
    build: 0.8.8 abef4490
    rand_getPeers: refused, gate: node
    rand_mint: refused, gate: node
    rand_importViewingKey: refused, gate: node
    rand_getViewingNotes: refused, gate: node
    rand_removeViewingKey: refused, gate: node
    batch: refused
    public-rpc: ok
exit: 0

